    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 4,
      "text": "06 — AI REVIEW ASSIST · INCLUDED"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 5,
      "text": "Make Sharing Genuine Experiences Easier."
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 6,
      "text": "Customers often know they loved you — but not what to write. AI turns a few honest notes into a natural draft they control, edit and choose to publish."
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 7,
      "text": "Customer shares a few details about their real visit"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 8,
      "text": "AI drafts a natural review from only those details"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 9,
      "text": "Customer edits, approves and posts to Google themselves"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 10,
      "text": "Responsible by design: never fabricates experiences, never forces ratings, never auto-posts. The customer always stays in control."
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 11,
      "text": "How was Brew &amp; Bean?"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 12,
      "text": "“Great oat latte, fast wifi, friendly staff…”"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 13,
      "text": "AI draft — editable"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 14,
      "text": "“Loved the oat latte and quick service. Perfect spot to work — will be back!”"
    },
    {
      "tag": "span",
      "idx": 15,
      "text": "Edit"
